Delete on public.a14_p
  CTE wcte
    ->  Insert on public.a14_i
          Output: a14_i.q2
          ->  Result
                Output: '42'::bigint, '47'::bigint
  ->  Nested Loop
        Output: a14_p.ctid, wcte.*
        Join Filter: (a14_p.aa = wcte.q2)
        ->  Seq Scan on public.a14_p
              Output: a14_p.ctid, a14_p.aa
        ->  CTE Scan on wcte
              Output: wcte.*, wcte.q2
-- EXPLAIN

